    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/05736afdf9504969c63bb05988c96583.poster.avif?t=1753617221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/05736afdf9504969c63bb05988c96583.webm?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/05736afdf9504969c63bb05988c96583.mp4?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive together. Build your shelter. And never wander too far from the group.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Follow</strong> is a first-person or Third person\u00a0<strong>co-op survival horror game</strong> set on a remote island crawling with unnatural, zombie-like predators. Work together to explore, scavenge, build, and survive in a dynamic world where sound matters, night is deadly, and straying from your allies might be the last thing you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/baa7e43a09acfed6baba89abe716f43c.poster.avif?t=1753617221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/baa7e43a09acfed6baba89abe716f43c.webm?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/baa7e43a09acfed6baba89abe716f43c.mp4?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/d8eb4b9e46d5cefa47d0b13da18c0a0b.poster.avif?t=1753617221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/d8eb4b9e46d5cefa47d0b13da18c0a0b.webm?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/d8eb4b9e46d5cefa47d0b13da18c0a0b.mp4?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build to Survive</strong><br>Chop down trees, gather resources, and build shelters, traps, and defences. Every plank matters when night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-Player Co-Op</strong> <br>Team up with friends to survive \u2014 or die trying. Share supplies, build together, and fight off waves of infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart, Stalking Enemies</strong><br>Your enemies don\u2019t just wander \u2014 they <strong>hunt</strong>. They follow sound, light, and your scent. Stay quiet. Stay together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Base Building</strong><br>Snap-together foundations, walls, spikes, fires, and watchtowers. Create fortified encampments or hidden forest outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Fight</strong><br>Scavenge for weapons, food, tools, and crafting materials. Create melee weapons, torches, and makeshift gear to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong><br>Explore a large, hand-crafted island with shifting weather, dense forests, dark caves, and secret locations. Resources are scarce, and so is safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunger, Thirst, and Sanity</strong><br>Manage your survival stats. Eat raw meat and risk infection. Stay in the dark too long and start to lose your grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First or Third Person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with fully supported first- and third-person perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7-Day Horde Nights</strong><br>Every seventh night, the island erupts into chaos. Waves of infected descend on your base in relentless swarms, testing your defences and forcing you to fight for survival. Each Horde Night grows more dangerous, with stronger enemies, larger numbers, and new threats that push you to constantly adapt. Prepare wisely \u2014 because the seventh night is never the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/05736afdf9504969c63bb05988c96583.poster.avif?t=1753617221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/05736afdf9504969c63bb05988c96583.webm?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/05736afdf9504969c63bb05988c96583.mp4?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive together. Build your shelter. And never wander too far from the group.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Follow</strong> is a first-person or Third person\u00a0<strong>co-op survival horror game</strong> set on a remote island crawling with unnatural, zombie-like predators. Work together to explore, scavenge, build, and survive in a dynamic world where sound matters, night is deadly, and straying from your allies might be the last thing you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/baa7e43a09acfed6baba89abe716f43c.poster.avif?t=1753617221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/baa7e43a09acfed6baba89abe716f43c.webm?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/baa7e43a09acfed6baba89abe716f43c.mp4?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/d8eb4b9e46d5cefa47d0b13da18c0a0b.poster.avif?t=1753617221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/d8eb4b9e46d5cefa47d0b13da18c0a0b.webm?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863210/extras/d8eb4b9e46d5cefa47d0b13da18c0a0b.mp4?t=1753617221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build to Survive</strong><br>Chop down trees, gather resources, and build shelters, traps, and defences. Every plank matters when night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-Player Co-Op</strong> <br>Team up with friends to survive \u2014 or die trying. Share supplies, build together, and fight off waves of infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart, Stalking Enemies</strong><br>Your enemies don\u2019t just wander \u2014 they <strong>hunt</strong>. They follow sound, light, and your scent. Stay quiet. Stay together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Base Building</strong><br>Snap-together foundations, walls, spikes, fires, and watchtowers. Create fortified encampments or hidden forest outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Fight</strong><br>Scavenge for weapons, food, tools, and crafting materials. Create melee weapons, torches, and makeshift gear to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong><br>Explore a large, hand-crafted island with shifting weather, dense forests, dark caves, and secret locations. Resources are scarce, and so is safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunger, Thirst, and Sanity</strong><br>Manage your survival stats. Eat raw meat and risk infection. Stay in the dark too long and start to lose your grip on reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First or Third Person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with fully supported first- and third-person perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7-Day Horde Nights</strong><br>Every seventh night, the island erupts into chaos. Waves of infected descend on your base in relentless swarms, testing your defences and forcing you to fight for survival. Each Horde Night grows more dangerous, with stronger enemies, larger numbers, and new threats that push you to constantly adapt. Prepare wisely \u2014 because the seventh night is never the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a mysterious island, build a base, and survive the night. Scavenge with friends and face creatures that hunt in packs. But every seventh night, a relentless Horde descends, testing your defences and your will to survive. Stay quiet. Don\u2019t follow.",
